  "memo": "Recommend clear. R08 holds because three accounts used the address, but the household exception applies: shipping is to the current home address, registered for 273.2956365740741 days. R08 therefore contributes no adverse family. No other rule holds, and no earlier outcome settles the order. With no adverse family, §6.6(c) requires clear; verification is unnecessary. Household sharing is more plausible than takeover on these facts. The failed installment does not establish never-pay intent and cannot justify a fraud action. This recommendation is advisory and sets no queue priority."
